msgid "The API key was rejected. Check the key and the API address."
msgstr "API 密钥被拒绝。请检查密钥和接口地址。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:164
msgid "The provider reports a billing or balance problem. Top up or check the account."
msgstr "服务商提示账单或余额有问题。请充值或检查账户。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:165
msgid "The model or API address was not found. Check the model name."
msgstr "找不到模型或接口地址。请检查模型名称。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:166
msgid "The provider rejected the requests as invalid. Check the model and settings, then run the connection test."
msgstr "服务商认为请求无效。请检查模型和设置，然后运行连接测试。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:167
msgid "Rate limit reached; requests resume automatically."
msgstr "已达到频率上限，稍后自动恢复。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:168
msgid "The provider's daily quota is used up; requests resume automatically later."
msgstr "服务商当天额度已用完，稍后自动恢复。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:169
msgid "The provider returned server errors; requests resume automatically."
msgstr "服务商返回服务器错误，稍后自动恢复。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:170
msgid "Requests timed out; requests resume automatically."
msgstr "请求超时，稍后自动恢复。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:171
msgid "Network error while contacting the provider."
msgstr "连接服务商时网络出错。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:172
msgid "The provider returned an unreadable response."
msgstr "服务商返回的内容无法读取。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:173
msgid "The model's answers were repeatedly cut off, unreadable or misaligned, so they were discarded; requests resume automatically."
msgstr "模型的回答接连被截断、无法读取或对位错乱，已全部丢弃；稍后自动恢复。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:190
msgid "Not configured yet."
msgstr "尚未配置。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:196
msgid "Open AI Translator settings"
msgstr "打开 AI 翻译设置"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:197
msgid "The daily character limit above also applies to AI Translator (sent characters, retries included)."
msgstr "上方的每日字符上限同样适用于 AI 翻译（按发送的字符计，含重试）。"

