#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:291
msgid "Leave empty to use the default address of the selected service. HTTPS only. For relays, enter the address that ends before /chat/completions (often ending in /v1)."
msgstr "留空则使用所选服务的默认地址。只接受 HTTPS。中转站请填到 /chat/completions 之前的部分（通常以 /v1 结尾）。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:293
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:295
msgid "Set in wp-config.php (AITP_API_KEY)."
msgstr "已在 wp-config.php 中设置（AITP_API_KEY）。"

#. translators: %s: last 4 characters
