msgstr "模型"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:306
msgid "Model name exactly as the provider writes it, e.g. gemini-3.5-flash, gpt-4.1-mini, deepseek-chat."
msgstr "按服务商写法填写模型名称，例如 gemini-3.5-flash、gpt-4.1-mini、deepseek-chat。"

