msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:320
msgid "Empty = provider default (recommended for Gemini 3)."
msgstr "留空 = 使用服务商默认值（Gemini 3 推荐留空）。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:323
msgid "Translation rules"
msgstr "翻译规则"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:324
msgid "Protected terms"
msgstr "保护词"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:324
msgid "One per line. Brand and product names that must appear unchanged (exact spelling and capitals), e.g. OKAY EYEWEAR."
msgstr "每行一个。必须原样出现的品牌名和产品名（拼写和大小写都不能变），例如 OKAY EYEWEAR。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:325
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:325
msgid "One rule per line: source term => language: preferred | alternative ; !forbidden. Language can be a code (fr, es_MX) or * for all. Example: tinted lenses => es_MX: micas tintadas | lentes tintados ; !polarizadas"
msgstr "每行一条：源词 => 语言: 首选 | 备选 ; !禁用词。语言可写代码（fr、es_MX），* 表示所有语言。例：tinted lenses => es_MX: micas tintadas | lentes tintados ; !polarizadas"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:326
msgid "Protected patterns"
msgstr "保护格式"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:326
msgid "Optional. One regular expression per line (without delimiters); every match must reappear unchanged. Technical standards (EN ISO 12312-1, ANSI Z80.3 …) and model codes (TR90, UV400) are protected automatically."
msgstr "可选。每行一个正则表达式（不带分隔符）；每个匹配到的内容都必须原样保留。技术标准（EN ISO 12312-1、ANSI Z80.3 等）和型号代码（TR90、UV400）会自动保护。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:327
msgid "About the site"
msgstr "网站简介"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:327
msgid "Short description sent with every request: industry, audience, tone. Example: B2B manufacturer of kids sunglasses and optical frames; formal business tone."
msgstr "每次请求都会附上的简短说明：行业、受众、语气。例：儿童太阳镜和光学镜架的 B2B 制造商；正式商务语气。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:329
msgid "Checks"
msgstr "检查项"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:331
msgid "Model numbers and material codes must stay unchanged (TR90, UV400, OK-A1001)"
msgstr "型号和材料代码必须保持不变（TR90、UV400、OK-A1001）"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:332
msgid "Size labels must stay unchanged (S, M, L, XL)"
msgstr "尺码必须保持不变（S、M、L、XL）"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:333
msgid "Flag added claims (guaranteed, certified, in stock, polarized, reinforced, best …)"
msgstr "标出多加的宣传说法（保证、认证、现货、偏光、加强、最好等）"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:339
msgid "Flagged translations"
msgstr "被标记的译文"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:340
msgid "Save them and add them to the review list (recommended)"
msgstr "保存并加入待复核列表（推荐）"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:340
msgid "Do not save them; keep the original until reviewed"
msgstr "不保存，复核前继续显示原文"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:343
msgid "Applies to possible meaning changes (added claims, glossary). Broken structure, missing numbers, untranslated or truncated text is never saved."
msgstr "只针对可能改变意思的情况（多加的说法、术语表）。结构损坏、数字缺失、没翻译或被截断的译文一律不保存。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:346
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:347
msgid "Seconds per page view"
msgstr "每次页面访问的秒数"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:347
msgid "Maximum time spent translating during one page view. Strings not finished are translated on a later view."
msgstr "一次页面访问里最多花在翻译上的时间。没来得及翻的文字会在之后的访问中继续翻译。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:348
msgid "Strings per call"
msgstr "每次调用的文字条数"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:348
msgid "How many strings TranslatePress hands over at once."
msgstr "TranslatePress 一次交给引擎多少条文字。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:349
